   "text": "Identity \u00b7 Permissions (allow / deny / unknown) \u00b7 Hospital data walls \u00b7 Audit (hash-chained)\nEvents & jobs \u00b7 Settings tree \u00b7 Numbering \u00b7 Storage \u00b7 Crypto \u00b7 Sandbox \u00b7 System health",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Identity \u00b7 Permissions (allow / deny / unknown) \u00b7 Hospital data walls \u00b7 Audit (hash-chained)\nEvents & jobs \u00b7 Settings tree \u00b7 Numbering \u00b7 Storage \u00b7 Crypto \u00b7 Sandbox \u00b7 System health",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
